---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { BRAND } from '../site';
---
<Page title="Grievance officer" path="/grievance/" kicker="Complaints" description={`How to raise a complaint about content on ${BRAND.name}, and our response times.`}>
  <p>If you believe something we published is inaccurate, unfair or unlawful, you can complain to our grievance officer.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Grievance officer:</strong> named here before launch</li>
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${BRAND.grievanceEmail}`}>{BRAND.grievanceEmail}</a></li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What happens next</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>We acknowledge your complaint within 24 hours.</li>
    <li>We re-check the disputed claim against its sources.</li>
    <li>If it is wrong or one-sided, we correct it or add the response, and log the fix on the page and on our <a href="/corrections/">corrections page</a>.</li>
    <li>We send you a decision within 15 days.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Please include the page link, the exact sentence you are disputing, and any evidence. Legal notices are passed to our lawyer the same day.</p>
</Page>
